#. Tag: para
#: man-kappfinder.1.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The KDE application finder (&kappfinder;) looks for legacy and third party "
"applications that are installed on your system and adds them to the KDE menu "
"system."
msgstr ""

